          "name": "Complete your Selections",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"bundle_box\"><div class=\"bundle_title\"><span class=\"text\">Complete your selections </span></div>\n<div class=\"bundle_text\"><p>Once you've selected your colors, sizes and added all the product to your cart, apply the code <strong>{{ product.metafields.custom.discount_code.value }}</strong> at checkout to unlock the special price.</p></div></div>\n<style>\n.bundle_box {\n  text-align: left;\npadding:20px 0; \n}\n.bundle_title, .bundle_text { \n    line-height: 1.2;\n}\n.bundle_title {\n  font-size:25px;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom:.5em;\n\n}\n.bundle_text {\n  text-align: justify;\n}\n.complementary-products-title {\n  display: none;\n}\n.bundle_text strong, .intro_text strong, .productView-title {\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color:var(--iamcolor_bundle);\n}\n.bundle_text :last-child {\n  margin-bottom: 0 !important;\n}\n .complementary-products-slider .product {\nmax-width:249px;\n}\n</style>"
